  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boosting the Nutrition Pipeline with a Strategic Stockpile in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this programme is to address malnutrition through the prepositioning of life-saving nutrition commodities for the management of wasted children. The programme will complement FCDO&#x2019;s strategy to deliver life-saving humanitarian work by prioritising the most vulnerable, protecting the most at-risk and preventing stock-out to enable the delivery of essential life-saving nutrition services.</narrative>
  </description>
